  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_01",
      "hash64": "80DA18B6BFF93169",
      "text": "Kommt herein, schaut heraus![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_02",
      "hash64": "80DA15B6BFF92C50",
      "text": "Eure Schuhe könnt ihr ruhig anbehalten.\\c\\nWenn sie arg verdreckt sind, wascht sie nur\\nbitte kurz am Wasserhahn beim Eingang ab.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_03",
      "hash64": "80DA16B6BFF92E03",
      "text": "Ist schick und sauber hier, was? Diese Einrichtung\\nwurde erst kürzlich gebaut und kann daher selbst\\r\\nmit dem modernen Schnickschnack der Großstadt\\r\\nmithalten.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 148,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 162,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_04",
      "hash64": "80DA1BB6BFF93682",
      "text": "Das ist der Gemeinschaftsraum. Hier könnt ihr\\nnach Belieben fernsehen, euch unterhalten...\\r\\nWas immer ihr wollt![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_05",
      "hash64": "80DA1CB6BFF93835",
      "text": "Die Kantine befindet sich dort vorne und hier\\nsind die Toiletten...[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_06",
      "hash64": "80DA19B6BFF9331C",
      "text": "Dort hinten geht es zu den Schlafräumen,\\nwo ihr euch ausruhen könnt.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_07",
      "hash64": "80DA1AB6BFF934CF",
      "text": "Da wir genug Platz haben, bekommt jeder\\nsein eigenes Zimmer.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_08",
      "hash64": "80DA1FB6BFF93D4E",
      "text": "So, das wäre dann auch schon alles, was ihr\\nwissen müsst, denke ich.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_09",
      "hash64": "80DA20B6BFF93F01",
      "text": "Wenn ihr Fragen habt, wendet euch einfach\\nan die Mitarbeiter am Empfang.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_bbteacher_01",
      "hash64": "FFFDC851C0E18FAF",
      "text": "Wunderbar! Vielen Dank für die Erklärungen![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_bbteacher_02",
      "hash64": "FFFDC951C0E19162",
      "text": "Na, wollt ihr nicht auch etwas zum\\nHerrn Verwalter sagen?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_select_01",
      "hash64": "CC80CF2E01435893",
      "text": "Danke für die Gastfreundschaft!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_select_02",
      "hash64": "CC80D02E01435A46",
      "text": "Danke, dass Sie sich um uns kümmern!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_all_01",
      "hash64": "C7D65FF5EF2D2204",
      "text": "Danke, dass wir hier übernachten dürfen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_all_02",
      "hash64": "C7D662F5EF2D271D",
      "text": "Jaaaaa, danke schön!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_10",
      "hash64": "80DD1DB6BFFB6FBF",
      "text": "Oh, wie höflich ihr alle seid! Da geht einem\\nja richtig das Herz auf![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_11",
      "hash64": "80DD1CB6BFFB6E0C",
      "text": "Fühlt euch bitte ganz wie zu Hause![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_bbteacher_03",
      "hash64": "FFFDCA51C0E19315",
      "text": "Ihr seid sicher erschöpft von der langen Reise.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_bbteacher_04",
      "hash64": "FFFDC351C0E18730",
      "text": "Es ist noch etwas früh, aber lasst uns schon mal\\nzu Abend essen und dann bald schlafen gehen.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_12",
      "hash64": "80DD1FB6BFFB7325",
      "text": "Wir haben eine ganze Menge Essen für euch\\nvorbereitet, also lasst es euch schmecken![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_students_01",
      "hash64": "0CD6A086E2AE6EE3",
      "text": "Juhuuu!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_students_02",
      "hash64": "0CD6A186E2AE7096",
      "text": "Vielen Dank, das war echt lecker!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_bbteacher_05",
      "hash64": "FFFDC451C0E188E3",
      "text": "Für heute gibt es kein Programm mehr, also steht\\ndir der Abend zur freien Verfügung.\\c\\nAber denk daran, dass die Exkursion dann\\nmorgen richtig losgeht![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 152,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_bbteacher_06",
      "hash64": "FFFDC551C0E18A96",
      "text": "Sieh zu, dass du nicht verschläfst![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_13",
      "hash64": "80DD1EB6BFFB7172",
      "text": "Hat dir die Küche der Kitakami-Provinz\\ngeschmeckt?[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_bbteacher_07",
      "hash64": "FFFDC651C0E18C49",
      "text": "Die Schüler der Blaubeer-Akademie stoßen\\nmorgen zu uns. Seid nett zueinander, ja?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_student1_01",
      "hash64": "8DEE76AA6CF16941",
      "text": "Was morgen wohl alles ansteht? Ich werde vor\\nAufregung bestimmt kaum schlafen können!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_student2_01",
      "hash64": "89773693999F984E",
      "text": "Das Essen hier in Kitakami wirkt so gesund,\\naber es ist trotzdem total lecker!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_student3_01",
      "hash64": "B6C42299FC1E3DA3",
      "text": "Gaaah... Da ist ein Käfer-Pokémon in meinem\\nZimmer!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_stopper_01",
      "hash64": "D98AD6A61E5432B0",
      "text": "[EMPTY 30]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
